{"code":"039740","name":"한국정보공학","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"판매업체","sector_desc":"도매·유통 판매업. 거래 물량과 마진이 실적을 결정합니다.","desc":"동사는 1990년 소프트웨어 개발업체로 설립, 2000년 코스닥 상장 후 2005년 한국HP 총판계약 체결로 IT하드웨어 유통업으로 전환함. 현재 한국HPE, HPI, 한국Lenovo, H3C, Everpure 총판 등 유통사업을 영위하며, 주요 취급품목은 컴퓨터, 서버, 스토리지 등 전산장비임. 종속회사로 창업투자 화이텍인베스트먼트, 이커머스솔루션 샵링커지앤씨, IT교육 솔데스크를 보유하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":2540.0,"open":2540.0,"high":2725.0,"low":2410.0,"volume":18305,"amount":46494700.0,"ret_1d":-2.1195,"gap":-2.1195,"range_pct":12.4016,"ret_5":0.5941,"ret_20":-13.1624,"ret_60":-15.894,"ret_120":-39.2344,"ret_250":-14.1892,"ma20":2792.0,"ma60":2997.9167,"ma120":3290.0417,"ma200":3358.4,"close_vs_ma200":-24.3687,"close_vs_ma60":-15.2745,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-52.8469,"r2_60":0.6726,"slope_120":-58.7495,"r2_120":0.6098,"slope_250":-0.3941,"r2_250":0.0001,"high52":6050.0,"low52":2410.0,"pos_52w":3.5714,"dd_52w":-58.0165,"mdd_1y":-50.0,"atr14_pct":9.7863,"vol_ann_60":43.1757,"vol_avg20":9013.15,"vol_ratio20":2.0309,"vr5":0.8294,"vr20":0.11,"amount_avg5":36426937.0,"amount_avg20":24948660.5,"amount_avg60":48985160.0833,"obv_chg20":-24.7133,"turnover_20":2.2481,"pv_eff_20":-5.8549,"rsi14":36.3972,"frgn_net_5":-14148.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.1764,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.1764,"frgn_net_20":-49477.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.617,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.617,"frgn_net_60":-25347.0,"inst_net_60":4000.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.3161,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0499,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.2662,"frgn_net_120":-147374.0,"inst_net_120":12000.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-1.8379,"inst_net_120_pct":0.1497,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.6883,"foreign_ratio":1.38,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.64,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":5.0,"op_margin_q":0.7949,"op_qoq":-54.5455,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":25.0,"rev_yoy":70.9239,"op_trend_4q":62.2222,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.46,"debt_ratio":128.55,"per":4.66,"pbr":0.38,"div_yield":null,"for